<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portal de Documentación y Manuales - Medienpass</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-indigo-50 to-purple-50 text-slate-800 flex flex-col">

    <!-- Top Navigation -->
    <header class="glass-panel sticky top-0 z-50 px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/50">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30">
                <i class="fas fa-book-open text-xl"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-bold text-lg leading-tight text-slate-900">Medienpass <span class="text-blue-600">Docs</span></h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Deutsche Schule - Portal de Conocimiento</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-100 text-blue-700">
                <i class="fas fa-user-circle mr-1.5"></i> Rol: <%= userRole.toUpperCase() %>
            </span>
            <% if (userRole === 'admin') { %>
                <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl shadow-sm transition">Volver al Panel</a>
            <% } else if (userRole === 'teacher') { %>
                <a href="/teacher/worksheets" class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl shadow-sm transition">Volver al Panel</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <a href="/profile" class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl shadow-sm transition">Volver al Perfil</a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 font-semibold text-xs mb-6 animate-pulse">
            <i class="fas fa-sparkles"></i>
            <span>Plataforma Oficial de Estudio y Soporte</span>
        </div>
        
        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
            <div class="mb-8 w-full max-w-4xl p-4 bg-red-100 border border-red-300 text-red-800 rounded-2xl flex items-center space-x-3 shadow-md animate-bounce">
                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-xl text-red-600"></i>
                <p class="font-semibold text-sm"><%= error %></p>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight max-w-3xl mb-6 leading-tight">
            Explora la Documentación Oficial de <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-purple-600">Medienpass</span>
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">
            Selecciona el manual que deseas consultar. Encuentra guías paso a paso para usuarios, detalles arquitectónicos del sistema y especificaciones técnicas de la base de datos.
        </p>

        <!-- Manual Cards Grid -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 w-full max-w-5xl">
            
            <!-- User Manual Card -->
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col items-start text-left hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 border border-white/60 group relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 w-40 h-40 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-all"></div>
                
                <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i>
                </div>
                
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 mb-2">Guías de Operación</span>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Manual de Usuario</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
                    Aprende a utilizar la platforma paso a paso. Contiene guías ilustradas y flujos completos para <strong>Administradores, Docentes y Estudiantes</strong>. Ideal para resolver dudas operativas y sacar el máximo provecho al sistema.
                </p>
                
                <div class="w-full pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div class="flex space-x-2 text-slate-400 text-xs">
                        <span class="bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Admin</span>
                        <span class="bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Docente</span>
                        <span class="bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Alumno</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/docs/user" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/25 group-hover:shadow-blue-500/40 transition">
                        Consultar Manual <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Technical Manual Card -->
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col items-start text-left hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 border border-white/60 group relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 w-40 h-40 bg-purple-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-purple-500/20 transition-all"></div>
                
                <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-purple-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-xl shadow-purple-500/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <i class="fas fa-code"></i>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full mb-2">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600">Arquitectura & Código</span>
                    <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-full"><i class="fas fa-lock mr-1"></i> Solo Desarrollador</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Manual Técnico</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
                    Estudia a fondo la estructura del software. Explora el esquema relacional de <strong>Supabase</strong>, las políticas RLS, la arquitectura de rutas en Express, la inyección de dependencias y el motor de reportes.
                </p>
                
                <div class="w-full pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div class="flex space-x-2 text-slate-400 text-xs">
                        <span class="bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Supabase</span>
                        <span class="bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Express.js</span>
                        <span class="bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">EJS</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/docs/technical" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/25 group-hover:shadow-purple-500/40 transition">
                        Consultar Manual <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Quick Help Banner -->
        <div class="mt-16 w-full max-w-5xl glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between border border-white/60 text-left gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0">
                    <i class="fas fa-life-ring"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">¿Necesitas asistencia técnica directa en el aula?</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Si experimentas fallos de hardware o red, utiliza la Bitácora de Novedades.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <% if (userRole === 'teacher') { %>
                <a href="/teacher/bitacora" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-amber-500/20 transition whitespace-nowrap">
                    <i class="fas fa-plus-circle mr-1.5"></i> Reportar Novedad
                </a>
            <% } else if (userRole === 'admin') { %>
                <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-amber-500/20 transition whitespace-nowrap">
                    <i class="fas fa-tools mr-1.5"></i> Ver Novedades
                </a>
            <% } else { %>
                <a href="/profile" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl shadow transition whitespace-nowrap">
                    <i class="fas fa-home mr-1.5"></i> Ir al Inicio
                </a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="glass-panel mt-auto py-6 px-6 border-t border-white/50 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p>Medienpass App &copy; 2026 Deutsche Schule. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
